<title>PHILIPPINES: C&amp;P Homes down 6.12 pct at 11.50 pesos.</title>
<headline>C&amp;P Homes down 6.12 pct at 11.50 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mass housing developer C&amp;P Homes shed 75 centavos, or 6.12 percent, to 11.50 pesos in midsession on Monday as it succumbed to across-the-board selling in the market, brokers said.  </p>
<p>&quot;Fundamentally, there's no reason for it to go down. It was really caused by the prevailing negative sentiment in the market,&quot; said Alexis Cabel, analyst at AngPing &amp; Associates Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Cabel said C&amp;P should not be affected by the perceived glut in the high end property sector.</p>
<p>Some 1.12 million C&amp;P shares changed hands in midtrade.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418936 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
